{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-04/1064761/block/singleImage/3272789/wm/01KP5EEE0SHSQ2N1E2TR7F9V22.jpg?updatedAt=1795102994\"/><figcaption>銅鑼灣時代廣場電器舖發生盜竊案。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>銅鑼灣時代廣場發生盜竊案。周四（19日）晚上接近7時，警方接獲時代廣場一間電器舖的負責人報案，指店內有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭不翼而飛，總值約188萬元，懷疑遭人盜去。 警員到場經初步調查後，將案件列作「盜竊」跟進，追緝一名年約40歲男子歸案。據了解，涉事店舖為豐澤，涉案男子為店舖職員，懷疑有人監守自盜偷走相機及鏡頭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.283764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:43:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:17:35.236023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:57.774838+00:00","content_hash":"18c58c4714cb29f9244601468de4e0776ea30003a4c7b150c504f14c054684bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.283764+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}